Verify Copy Share URL wifi mati
    SeleniumLibrary.Wait Until Element Is Visible
    ...    //button[normalize-space()='Salin']

    ${share_url}=    SeleniumLibrary.Get Element Attribute
    ...    //input[contains(@value,'https://')]
    ...    value

    Log To Console
    ...    URL ASLI: ${share_url}

    Set Suite Variable
    ...    ${share_url}

    Click Button
    ...    //button[normalize-space()='Salin']

    Sleep    2s

    SeleniumLibrary.Capture Page Screenshot
    ...    EMBED

open new tab with share URL
    Execute Javascript
    ...    window.open()

    Switch Window
    ...    NEW

    Go To
    ...    ${share_url}

Verify page not found
    SeleniumLibrary.Wait Until Element Is Visible
    ...    //div[contains(@class,'error-code')]
    ...    timeout=10s

    SeleniumLibrary.Element Text Should Be
    ...    //div[contains(@class,'error-code')]
    ...    ERR_INTERNET_DISCONNECTED

Disable Internet
    ${result}=    Run Process
    ...    powershell
    ...    Disable-NetAdapter
    ...    -Name
    ...    "Wi-Fi"
    ...    -Confirm:$false
    ...    -PassThru
    ...    stdout=PIPE
    ...    stderr=PIPE

    Log To Console    OUT=${result.stdout}
    Log To Console    ERR=${result.stderr}

    Sleep    5s

Enable Internet
    Run Process
    ...    powershell
    ...    Enable-NetAdapter
    ...    -Name
    ...    "Wi-Fi"
    ...    -Confirm:$false

    Sleep    10s

